What is NOT included
--------------------
No Sony firmware, no system_plugin_bg.rco files and no data extracted from them (meshes,
textures, animations) are distributed with this program. The wallpaper renders files that the
user supplies. scripts/import-original-wave.sh extracts the original wave from an official PSP
update file that the user obtains themselves.

"PlayStation", "PSP", "PS2", "PSX" and "XMB" / "XrossMediaBar" are trademarks of Sony
Interactive Entertainment Inc. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Sony.


Third-party material
--------------------
