XMB month colour table and PS2 (PSX DESR) wave parameters (amplitudes, speeds, wavelength,
colour offsets, time-of-day brightness hours) follow the values published in OSD-XMB by
HiroTex, https://github.com/HiroTex/OSD-XMB (GPL-3.0). No OSD-XMB source code is included;
the shaders in shaders/ are an independent implementation.

pspdecrypt (John-K and contributors, GPL-3.0, https://github.com/John-K/pspdecrypt) is NOT
bundled; scripts/import-original-wave.sh downloads and builds it on the user's machine.
